  "name": "libblake2",
  "description": "A high-performance C implementation of the BLAKE2 cryptographic hash function family, including BLAKE2b, BLAKE2s, and their parallel variants BLAKE2bp and BLAKE2sp. The library features hand-optimized primitives utilizing SSE2, SSSE3, SSE4.1, AVX, and XOP instruction sets to achieve near-optimal throughput on x86_64 architectures.",
